    "id": {
      "judul": "Data Latih dan Tebakan",
      "instruksi": "Model AI belajar dari data latih: pikirkan apa yang dipelajarinya, lalu pilih jawaban yang paling masuk akal.",
      "pilihan": "pilihan",
      "c1": "model bisa salah menebak",
      "c2": "model pasti benar",
      "c3": "model berubah jadi kucing",
      "q1": "Model dilatih dengan 100 foto kucing oranye saja. Lalu diberi foto kucing hitam. Apa yang paling mungkin terjadi?",
      "c4": "berisi kucing berbagai warna dan pose",
      "c5": "berisi satu foto kucing saja",
      "c6": "berisi foto anjing saja",
      "q2": "Supaya model pengenal kucing lebih tepat, data latih sebaiknya…",
      "c7": "sekitar 30",
      "c8": "sekitar 5",
      "c9": "sekitar 100",
      "q3": "Data: hari hujan → payung terjual 30, 28, 32. Hari cerah → 5, 4, 6. Besok hujan. Tebakan terbaik penjualan payung?",
      "c10": "bisa menyebut apel sebagai jeruk",
      "c11": "jadi lebih pintar",
      "c12": "tidak terpengaruh",
      "q4": "Seseorang salah memberi label: 20 foto apel ditandai 'jeruk'. Akibatnya model…",
      "c13": "contoh baru yang belum pernah dilihatnya",
      "c14": "contoh yang sama dengan data latih",
      "c15": "tanpa contoh sama sekali",
      "q5": "Untuk menguji model dengan jujur, kita memakai…",
      "c16": "sekitar 85",
      "c17": "sekitar 70",
      "c18": "tepat 100",
      "q6": "Data latih: siswa yang tidur 9 jam rata-rata nilai 85, tidur 6 jam rata-rata 70. Seorang siswa tidur 9 jam. Tebakan nilainya?",
      "c19": "suara anak-anak",
      "c20": "suara orang dewasa",
      "c21": "semua sama baiknya",
      "q7": "Model pengenal suara hanya dilatih dengan suara orang dewasa. Siapa yang paling mungkin tidak dikenali dengan baik?",
      "c22": "catatan suhu dan hujan 3 tahun terakhir",
      "c23": "warna kesukaanmu",
      "c24": "nama hari ini",
      "q8": "Mana yang termasuk data latih untuk model penebak cuaca?",
      "c25": "kebanyakan video kucing",
      "c26": "acak sama sekali",
      "c27": "video masak saja",
      "q9": "Model memberi saran video berdasarkan video yang sering kamu tonton. Kalau kamu hanya menonton video kucing, sarannya kemungkinan…",
      "c28": "tambah contoh serigala berlabel benar",
      "c29": "hapus semua data",
      "c30": "matikan komputernya",
      "q10": "Model menebak 'anjing' padahal fotonya serigala. Apa yang paling membantu?",
      "c31": "tebakan terbaik dari pola di data",
      "c32": "selalu pasti benar",
      "c33": "diambil dari mimpi komputer",
      "q11": "Prediksi AI itu…",
      "c34": "pepaya",
      "c35": "mangga",
      "c36": "keduanya sama",
      "q12": "Data latih: 90 foto mangga, 10 foto pepaya. Buah mana yang mungkin lebih sering salah ditebak?"
    },
    "en": {
      "judul": "Training Data and Predictions",
      "instruksi": "An AI model learns from training data: think about what it learned, then choose the most sensible answer.",
      "pilihan": "choices",
      "c1": "the model may guess wrong",
      "c2": "the model is sure to be right",
      "c3": "the model turns into a cat",
      "q1": "A model is trained with 100 photos of orange cats only. Then it is given a photo of a black cat. What is most likely?",
      "c4": "include cats of many colours and poses",
      "c5": "contain just one cat photo",
      "c6": "contain only dog photos",
      "q2": "To make a cat-recognising model more accurate, the training data should…",
      "c7": "about 30",
      "c8": "about 5",
      "c9": "about 100",
      "q3": "Data: rainy days → umbrellas sold 30, 28, 32. Sunny days → 5, 4, 6. Tomorrow is rainy. Best guess for umbrellas sold?",
      "c10": "may call apples oranges",
      "c11": "becomes cleverer",
      "c12": "is not affected",
      "q4": "Someone labelled wrongly: 20 apple photos are tagged 'orange'. As a result the model…",
      "c13": "new examples it has never seen",
      "c14": "the same examples as the training data",
      "c15": "no examples at all",
      "q5": "To test a model fairly, we use…",
      "c16": "about 85",
      "c17": "about 70",
      "c18": "exactly 100",
      "q6": "Training data: students who sleep 9 hours average 85, those who sleep 6 hours average 70. A student sleeps 9 hours. Guess the mark?",
      "c19": "children's voices",
      "c20": "adults' voices",
      "c21": "all equally well",
      "q7": "A voice model was trained only on adult voices. Whose voice is it most likely to recognise badly?",
      "c22": "temperature and rain records from the last 3 years",
      "c23": "your favourite colour",
      "c24": "today's name",
      "q8": "Which of these is training data for a weather-guessing model?",
      "c25": "mostly cat videos",
      "c26": "completely random",
      "c27": "only cooking videos",
      "q9": "A model suggests videos based on what you watch most. If you only watch cat videos, its suggestions are likely…",
      "c28": "add correctly labelled wolf examples",
      "c29": "delete all the data",
      "c30": "switch off the computer",
      "q10": "A model guesses 'dog' but the photo is a wolf. What would help most?",
      "c31": "a best guess from patterns in data",
      "c32": "always certainly right",
      "c33": "taken from the computer's dreams",
      "q11": "An AI prediction is…",
      "c34": "papaya",
      "c35": "mango",
      "c36": "both the same",
      "q12": "Training data: 90 mango photos, 10 papaya photos. Which fruit is more likely to be guessed wrongly?"
    }
